1080:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** * Global variables:
1081:Generated_Source\PSoC5/ADC_DelSig.c **** *  ADC_DelSig_CountsPerVolt:  used to convert ADC counts to mVolts.
